			"id": "ann_1",
			"position": [
				-150.0,
				-250.0
			],
			"size": [
				520.0,
				250.0
			],
			"text": "08 — Physics: Joints, Area & Soft Body\n\nTests advanced COMP types:\n• Hinge joint: box pendulum swings from a static anchor\n• Pin joint: sphere tethered to a fixed point (3D ball-and-socket)\n• AreaCOMP: upward gravity zone (blue sphere region) lifts a\n  free-falling red box that drifts through it\n• SoftBodyCOMP: subdivided grid mesh drapes under gravity\n\nAll objects share one ground plane, camera, and light.\nDemonstrates JointCOMP, AreaCOMP, and SoftBodyCOMP.",
			"type": "note"
		}
	],
